  "body": "Developers are surprised that sandboxed iframe can navigate and/or\nredirect the user toward an external application.\n\nGeneral iframe navigation in the sandboxed iframe are not blocked\nnormally, because they stay within the iframe. However they can be seen\nas a popup or a top-level navigation when it opens an external\napplication. In this case, it makes sense to extend the scope of sandbox\nflags, and block malvertisers.\n\nThis patch gates access to external protocol from sandboxed iframe behind any of:\n- allow-popup\n- allow-top-level-navigation\n- allow-top-level-navigation-by-user-activation + UserGesture.\n\nThis addresses:\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2191\n\n- [X] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chrome: (I will request for an Intent-To-Ship)\n   * Firefox: https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/581 (worth prototyping)\n   * Safari: https://lists.webkit.org/pipermail/webkit-dev/2021-September/031988.html (pending)\n   \n- [X] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * How can I do it? `Hand-off to external application` is a at the boundary. Invoking external application or not is not observable from within the web platform.\n\n- [X] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: https://crbug.com/1148777\n   * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1735746\n   * Safari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=231727\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7124/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 15, 2021, 5:00 PM UTC (48348be)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7124/bd12a97...48348be/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 15, 2021, 5:00 PM UTC (48348be)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7124/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 15, 2021, 5:00 PM UTC (48348be)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7124/bd12a97...48348be/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 15, 2021, 5:00 PM UTC (48348be)\">diff</a> )",
